<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador April consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Ecuador April consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in April, the National Statistics and Census Institute said Wednesday:</p>
<p>    Food				     0.94 pct</p>
<p>    Clothing				 1.82 pct</p>
<p>    Housing				  3.62 pct</p>
<p>    Others				   3.15 pct</p>
<p>    Total				    2.04 pct</p>
<p>((-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
